From: WS-A <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:44:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] redfin: /dev/redwood-audio to the speakers (sound=4: sink
 ring, guard gain, iOS volume, amps gated after 2 s silence)

---
 bsd/dev/sweet_audio.c |  50 ++++++++++++--
 bsd/dev/sweet_sound.c | 151 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 167 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

